        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 8011, Modern Door Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 7 Inch Sideplate is a great addition to any contemporary home. This modern interior door set is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. Choose from a huge selection of fashionable knobs and levers including sleek and transitional designs. This Modern Sideplate will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8111-specifications.gif?v=1704354620\" width=\"228\" height=\"299\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Emtek 8111 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the 7 Inch Modern Door Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass trim and sideplate.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set. Choose your desired knob or lever.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Modern 7 Inch Sideplate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Width: 2-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Doors Thickness: 1-1/4\" - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions</b> \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs / levers on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior sideplate. Turning inside knob / lever will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs / levers, 2 sideplates, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-8114-finish.jpg?v=1704354621\" width=\"514\" height=\"115\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek 8111 Available Finishes\">\r\n</p>",
