                "description": "The Modern 7 Inch Sideplate is a great addition to any contemporary home. This modern interior door set is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions. Choose from a huge selection of fashionable knobs and levers including sleek and transitional designs. This Modern Sideplate will fit standard 2-1/8 inch door preparations with door thicknesses ranging from 1-1/4 inches to 3 inches thick and with backsets of 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n",
